            },
            "description": "Required auth. TaskRouterService.RejectReservation. NOT part of the default sequential flow -- mutually exclusive with Accept Reservation (a reservation must be Offered, not already Accepted, to reject it). Use this as an ALTERNATIVE to Accept Reservation when testing the reject path, not as a follow-on step."
          }
